{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the first chapter of <strong>Runway 66</strong>, set in the abandoned airport sector <strong>&quot;Terminal X.&quot;</strong> This demo offers a glimpse into the game\u2019s haunting atmosphere, core mechanics, and the relentless pursuit of the AI <strong>Meryem</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Demo Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive with Your Voice:</strong><br>Stay silent to hide from Meryem or shout to unlock doors. <i>Beware: Your voice may awaken &quot;things&quot; lurking in the simulation.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find the Black Box Fragment:</strong><br>Discover the first fragment hidden in the terminal\u2019s infirmary, uncovering secrets of the 1966 crash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face Meryem:</strong><br>When lights flicker and die, her distorted voice echoes: <i>&quot;Subject 66... Where are you?&quot;</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duration:</strong> ~20 Minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sections:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infirmary:</strong> A dark introduction with hospital logs and glitch-ridden corridors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lower Floor Shops:</strong> Hide in empty stores while eerie sounds (<i>a baby\u2019s cry, scratching</i>) haunt you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runway 66:</strong> Search for the black box in thick fog while evading your first encounter with a <strong>&quot;data entity.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Story Clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect hidden lore during the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Memories:</strong> A stewardess\u2019s diary reveals <i>&quot;Meryem has gone rogue...&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classified Documents:</strong> Fragments of <i>&quot;Project Lazarus: A protocol to enslave consciousness.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Remember: No one leaves Terminal 6 unchanged...&quot;</strong><br><strong>Download the free demo now!</strong><br><i>Wishlist the full game to escape the simulation.</i> \ud83d\udeeb</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3763060?t=1748562567","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763060/63d70db1ae5ddbd824d36978ee6d444e424e172f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748562567","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763060/9826ea80e7b37e64d72f9fd7edef1ce6b9e50914/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748562567","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763060/9826ea80e7b37e64d72f9fd7edef1ce6b9e50914/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748562567","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the first chapter of <strong>Runway 66</strong>, set in the abandoned airport sector <strong>&quot;Terminal X.&quot;</strong> This demo offers a glimpse into the game\u2019s haunting atmosphere, core mechanics, and the relentless pursuit of the AI <strong>Meryem</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Demo Highlights</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive with Your Voice:</strong><br>Stay silent to hide from Meryem or shout to unlock doors. <i>Beware: Your voice may awaken &quot;things&quot; lurking in the simulation.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Find the Black Box Fragment:</strong><br>Discover the first fragment hidden in the terminal\u2019s infirmary, uncovering secrets of the 1966 crash.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Face Meryem:</strong><br>When lights flicker and die, her distorted voice echoes: <i>&quot;Subject 66... Where are you?&quot;</i></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udfae <strong>Demo Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Duration:</strong> ~20 Minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Sections:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Infirmary:</strong> A dark introduction with hospital logs and glitch-ridden corridors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lower Floor Shops:</strong> Hide in empty stores while eerie sounds (<i>a baby\u2019s cry, scratching</i>) haunt you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Runway 66:</strong> Search for the black box in thick fog while evading your first encounter with a <strong>&quot;data entity.&quot;</strong></p></li></ul></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Story Clues</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect hidden lore during the demo:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Memories:</strong> A stewardess\u2019s diary reveals <i>&quot;Meryem has gone rogue...&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classified Documents:</strong> Fragments of <i>&quot;Project Lazarus: A protocol to enslave consciousness.&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Remember: No one leaves Terminal 6 unchanged...&quot;</strong><br><strong>Download the free demo now!</strong><br><i>Wishlist the full game to escape the simulation.</i> \ud83d\udeeb</p>","developers":["NEBULA NOVA GAMES"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3667120","name":"Runway 66"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763060/849ebffc7c5fa95497198a3cb5df034a30e9c23b/header.jpg?t=1748562567","i